    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels so weird being in this apartment alone. like i walk through the rooms and i don't even recognize the space anymore. everything is just... quiet. i look in the mirror and i don't really see myself. i just feel like i'm watching someone else pretend to live.",
